Date: Fri, 27 Mar 2026 12:56:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 49/63] ANDROID: afdo: update kernel.afdo profile to include
 Rust Binder

A kernel.afdo profile was collected using Rust Binder. This commit
updates the afdo profile to the result of merging the existing afdo file
with the newly collected profile, keeping both Binder implementations
optimized.

Bug: 494546498
Change-Id: I396baecc638c0e06903ae06cd31cf0f7de29b34e
Signed-off-by: Alice Ryhl <aliceryhl@google.com>
(cherry picked from commit 49e3211dc6f78316f18eda489420693b4f42cc58)
Bug: 498166901
